        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Vendors, SHA-256-verifies, and performs Difference-of-Gaussians and gradient tangent orientation segmentation (`segment_euplectella_specimen`, L567-642) on the Public-domain *Euplectella aspergillum* glass sponge skeleton photograph (`datasets/sponge_spicule_hexactin/euplectella_aspergillum_specimen.jpg`), detecting orthogonal hexactin strut crossings (`89.6498 deg` vs theoretical `90.0 deg`), alternating diagonal bracing struts (`47.6843 deg` vs `45.0 deg`), and square lattice pitch `2.5000 mm` (`24.07 px`, `CV = 0.3997` across 536 inter-strut intervals)." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
